# Errors

## UNSUPPORTED_FEATURE

```text
[UNSUPPORTED_FEATURE] A JSX element name can't refer to an import that has to be read as a bracketed property, because the imported name is not a valid identifier, while `transform.jsx` is 'preserve'. Assign the import to a variable and use the variable as the element name.
   ╭─[ main.jsx:4:19 ]
   │
 4 │ export const a = <MyTag />;
   │                   ──┬──  
   │                     ╰──── 
───╯

```

